  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amazon Protection - support 270 indigenous people</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A FOREST OF PEACE is an initiative by Fundacao Lama Gangchen para a Cultura de Paz and Instituto A Nossa Jornada. The project will strengthen the HuniKui and Shanenawa INDIGENOUS ETHNIC GROUPS to guarantee their existence in the AMAZON RAINFOREST, which is being increasingly devastated. It will provide drinking water, food security, education and transport for 270 PEOPLE who were born and live in the forest. Indigenous people and territories are an important ecosystem for life on the planet.</narrative>
  </description>
